WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.470
(gentle music)
(birds chirping)

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:03.280
- [Narrator] In the
green fields of Provence,

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.730
in southeastern France,
lies a unique winery,

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.464
one operated entirely by French veterans.

00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:12.131
(vibrant music)

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.440
The Domaine du Capitaine Danjou Winery

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.600
has 100 acres of grape vines,

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.357
and overseeing them all
right is Alan Lonjarret.

00:00:22.309 --> 00:00:26.226
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:42.600
- [Narrator] The fields and winery

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.870
are staffed by veterans

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:46.070
of the storied French Foreign Legion,

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:47.781
a branch of the French Army.

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:48.614
(bright music)

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:49.750
It is unique because it is made up

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:52.332
nearly entirely of immigrants.

00:00:52.332 --> 00:00:56.249
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:13.063 --> 00:01:15.680
- [Narrator] On the grounds,
there is also a retirement home

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.910
that has been housing and
caring for the veterans

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.219
for over 60 years.

00:01:19.219 --> 00:01:23.136
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:40.072
(scissors snipping)

00:01:40.072 --> 00:01:43.989
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:51.982 --> 00:01:54.050
- [Narrator] The veterans
work together in the fields

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.170
to tend to the vines
and harvest the grapes.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:01.087
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:04.045 --> 00:02:05.654
(gentle music)

00:02:05.654 --> 00:02:09.571
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:24.100
- [Narrator] Residents also participate

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.580
in other activities,
including bookbinding,

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:29.910
ceramics, and tending to a uniform museum,

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:32.150
but it's the wine that's
their true passion.

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:35.350
It's shipped all over,
including to active legionnaires

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:37.800
on military bases around the world.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.077
And they plan to keep on improving it.

00:02:40.077 --> 00:02:43.994
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:49.421 --> 00:02:54.421
(gentle music)
(birds chirping)

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.493
(bright music)

